{
  "$description": "S1 \"Living Coast\" token deltas for brand/tokens.json (W2 ds-core). Shape matches TODAY's brand/build-tokens.mjs: $value = light (Pacific dawn), $extensions[\"ca.rnc.dark\"] = dark (Fir night), ca.rnc.css = CSS expression, ca.rnc.solid = opaque fallback. Deep-merge into tokens.json: every token listed here is added or replaced; tokens not listed are unchanged. CONTRACT §15 migration (ds-core, mechanical): swap each pair so $value = dark and $extensions[\"ca.rnc.light\"] = light, set ca.rnc.default = \"dark\", and emit light under :root[data-theme=light]. Source of every colour: .orchestra/direction (S1 palette.mjs), contrast table in DESIGN-DIRECTION.md §3 (558 checks, 0 fails).",
  "$extensions": {
    "ca.rnc.default": "dark",
    "ca.rnc.fontFaces": [
      {
        "family": "Inter Variable",
        "src": "/assets/fonts/inter-latin-var.woff2",
        "weight": "400 720",
        "style": "normal",
        "display": "swap",
        "preload": true,
        "note": "Body and UI. Metric-matched Arial fallback keeps swap CLS ~0."
      },
      {
        "family": "Newsreader Variable",
        "src": "/assets/fonts/newsreader-latin-italic-var.woff2",
        "weight": "400 520",
        "style": "italic",
        "display": "optional",
        "preload": true,
        "note": "NEW display:optional + preload (J2 V3): the accent phrase never swaps after first render, so it cannot shift the hero. generate() must read f.display (default swap)."
      }
    ],
    "ca.rnc.fallbacks": [
      {
        "family": "Inter Fallback",
        "local": "Arial",
        "size-adjust": "107.06%",
        "ascent-override": "90.49%",
        "descent-override": "22.56%",
        "line-gap-override": "0%"
      }
    ],
    "ca.rnc.generatorChanges": [
      "Honour ca.rnc.default = \"dark\": dark values on :root, light under :root[data-theme=\"light\"]; never consult prefers-color-scheme (CONTRACT §8 D1).",
      "Emit font-display from fontFaces[].display (default swap); emit <link rel=preload as=font crossorigin> for preload:true faces (layout.mjs reads the list).",
      "Reduced-motion block becomes @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { :root:not([data-motion=on]) {...} } plus :root[data-motion=off] {...} (CONTRACT §8).",
      "Reduced transparency / more contrast: materials solid (existing), plus --glass-blur:0px, --grain-opacity:0, --stage-opacity:0, and the card gradients flatten to bg-elevated.",
      "forced-colors: focus ring falls back to outline 2px solid Highlight / CanvasText; no box-shadow."
    ]
  },
